    {
      "text": "The policy has shifted from a lengthy, technical explanation of search mechanics to a clear, product-wide commitment that \"We don’t track you.\" This matters because DuckDuckGo now explicitly extends its no-tracking promise to its full suite of apps, extensions, email protection, and chat features, rather than focusing solely on web search.",
